DKC downstream source
=====================

This source package contains one common source tree for the v2, v3, and v4
binary package sets. The complete policy and dependency identity is recorded
under `debian/dkc/`.

To reconstruct the source archives without compiling binaries, keep the
downloaded `dkc-linux_*.orig.tar.xz` beside the extracted directory and run
from its parent:

    dpkg-source --build dkc-linux-*

To rebuild one flavor after installing the exact build dependencies recorded
under `debian/dkc/`, run inside a fresh extraction:

    debian/dkc/rebuild-flavor v2

Replace `v2` with `v3` or `v4` as needed. Run each flavor from a fresh
`dpkg-source -x` extraction because flavor selection intentionally narrows the
generated Debian control graph in place.

